~ convo_1
Az: I don't mean to be rude, but... why are you here?
Fenn: What do you mean?
Az: In the palace?
Fenn: I was invited!! King Oakley sent a letter to me personally. He said he was looking for candidates for new Knights! 
Az: Seriously?
Fenn: Yeah! 
Az: He reached out to you? A kid?
Fenn: Yup. He was super impressed with how much I knew about the other Knights, he just had to invite me to the castle.
Az: Hmph. Alright.
=> END

